---
// A Session's states and what moves it between them, for Concepts > The Session lifecycle. Inline
// SVG in the theme's colours, so it follows light and dark (docs/design/docs-style.md, "Components").
---

<figure class="life">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 820 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="life-title life-desc">
    <title id="life-title">A Session's states</title>
    <desc id="life-desc">
      A Session starts Active. It goes to sleep when idle or with Sleep now, and a prompt or Wake now
      wakes it. Deleting archives it, from Active or Asleep, and Restore makes it Asleep again. 30
      days after it was archived it is purged. While its Runner is offline, an Active or Asleep
      Session is Frozen, and it comes back Active or Asleep when the Runner is back.
    </desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="life-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" class="head" />
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Start -->
    <circle class="start" cx="22" cy="138" r="7" />
    <line class="wire" x1="30" y1="138" x2="56" y2="138" marker-end="url(#life-arrow)" />

    <!-- States -->
    {[
      { x: 60, y: 110, name: "Active", note: "Keep awake holds it", hot: true },
      { x: 330, y: 110, name: "Asleep", note: "Sandbox stopped" },
      { x: 600, y: 110, name: "Archived", note: "Sandbox destroyed" },
      { x: 195, y: 236, name: "Frozen", note: "its Runner is offline" },
    ].map((s) => (
      <g transform={`translate(${s.x} ${s.y})`}>
        <rect class={s.hot ? "state hot" : "state"} width="150" height="56" rx="10" />
        <text class={s.hot ? "name on-hot" : "name"} x="75" y="25" text-anchor="middle">{s.name}</text>
        <text class={s.hot ? "small on-hot" : "small"} x="75" y="44" text-anchor="middle">{s.note}</text>
      </g>
    ))}

    <!-- Active and Asleep -->
    <line class="wire" x1="210" y1="128" x2="326" y2="128" marker-end="url(#life-arrow)" />
    <text class="small" x="268" y="120" text-anchor="middle">idle, or Sleep now</text>
    <line class="wire" x1="330" y1="150" x2="214" y2="150" marker-end="url(#life-arrow)" />
    <text class="small" x="272" y="170" text-anchor="middle">a prompt, or Wake now</text>

    <!-- Asleep and Archived -->
    <line class="wire" x1="480" y1="128" x2="596" y2="128" marker-end="url(#life-arrow)" />
    <text class="small" x="538" y="120" text-anchor="middle">delete</text>
    <line class="wire" x1="600" y1="150" x2="484" y2="150" marker-end="url(#life-arrow)" />
    <text class="small" x="542" y="170" text-anchor="middle">restore</text>

    <!-- Active to Archived -->
    <path class="wire" d="M135 106 C 220 30, 590 30, 672 104" fill="none" marker-end="url(#life-arrow)" />
    <text class="small" x="405" y="46" text-anchor="middle">delete</text>

    <!-- Purged -->
    <line class="wire" x1="675" y1="170" x2="675" y2="226" marker-end="url(#life-arrow)" />
    <text class="small muted" x="675" y="248" text-anchor="middle">purged 30 days later</text>

    <!-- Frozen -->
    <line class="wire" x1="140" y1="170" x2="228" y2="232" marker-start="url(#life-arrow)" marker-end="url(#life-arrow)" />
    <line class="wire" x1="400" y1="170" x2="312" y2="232" marker-start="url(#life-arrow)" marker-end="url(#life-arrow)" />
    <text class="small muted" x="160" y="216" text-anchor="end">Runner offline</text>
    <text class="small muted" x="380" y="216">Runner back</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    The Hub decides a Session's state, and its Runner does what the Hub asks.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .life {
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }
  .life svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    font-family: var(--sl-font, system-ui, sans-serif);
  }
  .life figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  }
  .state {
    fill: var(--sl-color-gray-6);
    stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-5);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .hot {
    fill: #f6c445;
    stroke: #8c5f47;
  }
  .start {
    fill: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  }
  .wire {
    stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    stroke-width: 1.6;
  }
  .head {
    fill: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  }
  .name {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: var(--sl-color-white);
  }
  .small {
    font-size: 12px;
    fill: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
  }
  .on-hot {
    fill: #271d18;
  }
  .small.on-hot {
    fill: #3f332d;
  }
  .muted {
    fill: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  }
</style>
